#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:40
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_NeverSeenPokemon"
msgid ""
"There was someone here using a \n"
"POKéMON I've never seen before.\p"
"I never learned about it at\n"
"TRAINER'S SCHOOL at least.\p"
"I wonder where you can catch POKéMON\n"
"like that.$"
msgstr ""
"刚才这里有个人用着\n"
"我从没见过的宝可梦。\p"
"至少我在训练家学校\n"
"从没学过那种宝可梦。\p"
"不知道那种宝可梦\n"
"要去哪里才能抓到呢。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:48
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_NextStopBattleArena"
msgid ""
"Okay! Next stop, the BATTLE ARENA!\n"
"I'd better get the right POKéMON from\l"
"the PC Storage System.$"
msgstr ""
"好！下一站，对战竞技场！\n"
"我得从电脑的宝可梦保管系统里\l"
"把合适的宝可梦取出来。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:53
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_GoingThroughEveryChallenge"
msgid ""
"Giggle… I'm going to go through every\n"
"challenge with just this baby!$"
msgstr ""
"嘻嘻……我要只用这个小家伙\n"
"挑战所有的设施！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:57
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_Skitty"
msgid "SKITTY: Mya myaaah!$"
msgstr "向尾喵：喵～喵呜～！$"
